# Form controls

Source: [`docs/work-dashboard-design-spec.md`](../../docs/work-dashboard-design-spec.md) §12.

Use `Input`, `Select`, `Combobox`, `Button`, `Label`, `FieldRow`, and `LabeledField` from `@dc-inventory/ui`. Comfortable controls and in-row buttons share `min-h-(--space-input-height)`. If that height is wrong, change the primitive in `packages/ui`, not the page.

```tsx
// Wrong: raw input, invented height, sm secondary as the row action
<div className="flex items-center gap-2">
  <input className="h-10 rounded-md" />
  <Button variant="secondary" size="sm">Add Line</Button>
</div>

// Wrong: items-center lines the button up with labels, not inputs
<div className="flex items-center gap-4">
  <div className="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <Label>Vendor product</Label>
    <Combobox />
  </div>
  <Button size="sm">Add Line</Button>
</div>

// Right
<FieldRow>
  <LabeledField className="min-w-56 flex-1">
    <Label htmlFor="product">Vendor product</Label>
    <Combobox id="product" />
  </LabeledField>
  <Button type="submit" variant="primary">Add Line</Button>
</FieldRow>
```

- Row action: `variant="primary"`, default `md` size. `sm` / `ghost` are toolbar and table only.
- Button labels are Title Case and bold. Do not pass `font-medium` or sentence-case copy.
- On a page that hosts a table with actions, every `Button` includes a leading lucide icon. Pick the icon that matches the verb.
- Find, open-by-number, and list search use `TextInput density="compact"` at `w-52 shrink-0`. Never `flex-1` / `w-full` on a search field. Table search is `DataTable.Search`. Do not stack a second label above a toolbar placeholder; a short label is fine for a named lookup (`Open by PO #`).
- Label to control: `gap-field`. Field to field: `gap-field-group`. Row to table: `gap-form-section`.
- Never set `h-*`, `min-h-*`, or `py-*` on one control to make it fit.
